  "_about": "Tavi Orse's emotion tags -> face blendshape weights (M3-CHR-03; act1_npcs.md \u00a73.4). A pair is [L, R]; a scalar sets both sides of a paired shape. The villager default rows, with the sheet's overrides: worried (the week of waiting), grief held in front of his side (\"Kell couldn't swim\"), determined for the naming (\"Oruvel.\"; the chin lift is the name_rite clip). surprised -> smile is a Cinematics blend of the default rows. Shapes: the shared API (asha.md \u00a76.2). Tags: game/data/dialogue/emotions.json. Read by the villager stage and, once wired, by CutsceneSequencer (sequencer.json face_poses).",
